  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 375°F (190°C).",
    "Season the hind shank with salt, black pepper, cumin, paprika, and cayenne pepper.",
    "Heat the olive oil in the tajine over medium heat. Add the chopped onion and cook until browned.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for an additional 1 minute.",
    "Add the hind shank and cook until browned on all sides.",
    "Add the remaining ingredients to the tajine and cover with the clay lid.",
    "Transfer the tajine to the preheated oven and braise for 2 hours.",
    "Remove the tajine from the oven and let it cool slightly.",
    "Serve the hind shank with the rich, flavorful sauce spooned over the top."
